        "text_cKrN3F": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3><strong>On-the-Go Forest Atmosphere Delivery</strong></h3><p>\"Taste the Forest.\" Mindscape® and BlissThera® &nbsp;Forest Medicine based formulas can be experienced via the<strong> Forest Myst Flute</strong>—a patented, breath-powered device that emits a forest-derived botanical myst you taste - without heat, smoke, smell, or vapor clouds. This innovative, non-electronic technology enables discreet therapeutic use anywhere—at your desk in the office, at the table in a restaurant, at the airport, or even in your seat mid-flight.&nbsp;</p><p>Unlike traditional vape or combustion methods, <em>Mindscaping</em>® using the <strong>Forest Myst Flute</strong> offers a clean aromatic tasting experience that offers subtle therapeutic effects that elevate headspace and mood without the harshness or health risks of smoke or synthetic stimulants. It's tasted, not inhaled. It's a completely unique technology and true natural wellness activity you can feel—anytime, anywhere.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
